{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"prerequisites","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisites"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React 18.x.x or 19.x.x"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ReactDOM 18.x.x or 19.x.x with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createRoot"},{"type":"text","value":" support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript 5.3.x or higher (recommended)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"loose":true,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the package"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Choose your package manager:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/react-router","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/react-router","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"yarn add @tanstack/react-router","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"bun add @tanstack/react-router","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"deno add npm:@tanstack/react-router","lang":"sh"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verify installation"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check that the package appears in your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@tanstack/react-router\": \"^x.x.x\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites","level":2},{"id":"installation-steps","text":"Installation Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Prerequisites\n\n- React 18.x.x or 19.x.x\n- ReactDOM 18.x.x or 19.x.x with `createRoot` support\n- TypeScript 5.3.x or higher (recommended)\n\n## Installation Steps\n\n1. **Install the package**\n\n   Choose your package manager:\n\n   ```sh\n   npm install @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   pnpm add @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   yarn add @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   bun add @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   deno add npm:@tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n2. **Verify installation**\n\n   Check that the package appears in your `package.json`:\n\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"dependencies\": {\n       \"@tanstack/react-router\": \"^x.x.x\"\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: How to Install TanStack Router\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- React 18.x.x or 19.x.x\n- ReactDOM 18.x.x or 19.x.x with `createRoot` support\n- TypeScript 5.3.x or higher (recommended)\n\n## Installation Steps\n\n1. **Install the package**\n\n   Choose your package manager:\n\n   ```sh\n   npm install @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   pnpm add @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   yarn add @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   bun add @tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n   ```sh\n   deno add npm:@tanstack/react-router\n   ```\n\n2. **Verify installation**\n\n   Check that the package appears in your `package.json`:\n\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"dependencies\": {\n       \"@tanstack/react-router\": \"^x.x.x\"\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n"}
